- `<G355-1-SUMMARY>` = The port band test cell E3 passes with zero connections made: its control compares the dial count with the constant that sets it, so DIALS = 0 stays green (summary length with the longest drafted field values: 154; limit 255)
- `<G355-1-BLUF>` = In __tests__/rd573-jest-port-band-outside-ephemeral-range.test.js at main {MAIN}, cell E3 (line {L_E3NAME}) sets the number of connections it makes with const DIALS at line {L_DIALS}, and its control (lines {L_CTL1} to {L_CTL2}) expects the measured counts to equal DIALS itself. A run with DIALS set to 0 holds no connection and still passes, and so does DIALS set to 1, while the cell name promises 64 held client sockets.
