- `<G355-1-DET1>` = Measured by the tester with a plant: DIALS = 0 and DIALS = 1 each left all five cells green (five of five). The plant is an edit of the test's own constant. The cell text that would turn it red is an independent literal in the control in place of DIALS.
- `<G355-1-DET2>` = Source: the tester's report in the project folder, 1_Project_Definition/Briefs/2026-11-06_B1342_STATUS.md (the first finding of that report, graded Minor), made from a read of the change that landed as the merge commit e386ada9efb7435c01e0501114c6dfbc6b1244bb on main. Line numbers in this ticket are read from the files at main {MAIN} by grep -n at {CLOCK} AEDT.
